# Verible-only SystemVerilog source list: bare-SVA fragments that are `include`d
# into a module under an `ifdef (e.g. ABV) rather than compiled standalone. The
# Makefile's Verible lint/format targets read these in addition to the compile
# sources in rtl/sources.vf; the simulators and the cocotb flow never see them.
# Each non-comment, non-blank line is a bare file path, validated to exist.
rtl/top_abv.sv
